ber/12723-react0rman","name":"react0rman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T12:56:03-07:00","id":1067747,"title":"","content":"There's always gaming over Google Hangouts, it's a lot more simplistic (except when Google's being difficult) and my online group has used that several times to game. You can even record the session for posterity if you want. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-25T07:18:47-07:00","id":1068000,"title":"","content":"Are you looking to run a Beast game or play in a Beast game? I have been an avid user of Roll20 (Premium User since it's inception) and run numerous games (D&amp;D, Geist, VtR2E, Scarred Lands 5E, and VtM20th as well as many other one-shots). I am actually in the process of putting together a Beast game. If you'd like, PM me and we'll throw some ideas back and forth and see if it works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theo